From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:48:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1100/3799] soh: rename D_80B3A8E0 -> sTargetModes

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: s16 table indexed by the range index decoded from world.rot.z and assigned straight to actor.targetMode.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wonder_Talk2/z_en_wonder_talk2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wonder_Talk2/z_en_wonder_talk2.c  | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wonder_Talk2/z_en_wonder_talk2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wonder_Talk2/z_en_wonder_talk2.c
index 67736d5b3..f8a7b6032 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wonder_Talk2/z_en_wonder_talk2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Wonder_Talk2/z_en_wonder_talk2.c
@@ -33,7 +33,8 @@ const ActorInit En_Wonder_Talk2_InitVars = {
     NULL,
 };
 
-static s16 D_80B3A8E0[] = { 6, 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80B3A8E0: s16 table indexed by the range index decoded from world.rot.z and assigned straight to actor.targetMode.
+static s16 sTargetModes[] = { 6, 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };  // was D_80B3A8E0 [LLM:HIGH]
 
 void EnWonderTalk2_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
 }
@@ -60,7 +61,7 @@ void EnWonderTalk2_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
             rangeIndex = 0;
         }
 
-        this->actor.targetMode = D_80B3A8E0[rangeIndex];
+        this->actor.targetMode = sTargetModes[rangeIndex];  // was D_80B3A8E0 [LLM:HIGH]
 
         osSyncPrintf("\n\n");
         // "originally?"
